VE - BE THERE. NOW. \n\nExperience live sports and concerts in immersive 360\u00b0 on your Meta Quest. Don\u2019t just watch the moment. Step inside it. \n\nL1VE immerses you inside the world\u2019s biggest sports and music events, like you are really there. Feel the energy of the crowd, follow the action from different positions and experience live moments from anywhere. \n\nWith L1VE, you\u2019re not sitting on the couch or watching on a screen. You\u2019re inside the stadium.\n\n\n**Features**\n\n**Live and On Demand Events**\n\nWatch live matches, concerts and major events, plus replays and highlights anytime. \n\n \n\n**Choose Your Perspective**\n\nExplore the event from various positions and switch between different camera angles. \n\n \n\n**Immersive Performance**\n\nWatch events with up to 14K resolution, 360\u00b0 field of view, native stereoscopic 3D and 72 fps delivered directly to your headset. \n\n \n\n**Spatial Sound**\n\nExperience the atmosphere of the stadium or concert with immersive audio that surrounds you.  \n\n \n**Watch Together**\n\nJoin friends and experience live moments together in the same environment. \n\nDownload L1VE, put on your Meta Quest and step inside the moment. \n", "short_description": "Experience live sports and concerts in immersive 360\u00b0 on your Meta Quest. - BE THERE. NOW.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://prod.l1ve.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "L1VE GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.l1ve.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "2687655338230691"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": nu